.TH FL-FONTS 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop 0.1.4" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-fonts \- preview, install and remove fonts
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-fonts\fR [\fIFONT-FILE\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lists the font families fontconfig knows and shows each style of the
selected one with a sample text at a chosen size. Fonts can be found by
name and limited to monospace ones or to those you installed. \fBInstall
Fonts\fR copies font files (TTF, OTF, TTC, WOFF) to
\fI~/.local/share/fonts\fR for you; fonts you installed can be removed.
Font files given on the command line (opened from the file manager) are
offered for installing.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfc-list\fR(1), \fBfc-cache\fR(1), \fBfl-charmap\fR(1)
